  "slug": "computer-organization",
  "chapterId": "chapter-8",
  "html": "<h1 id=\"section-464\">计组套题</h1>\n<h2 id=\"section-465\">K1</h2>\n<h3 id=\"section-466\">Choice</h3>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/176aff936bfc71078df4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/b82598c07a8220920b2c.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/f6ccc3dfc043fe3a8740.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/871ce8ee5dae7e8b331b.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/1183931fe797660484d8.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/f45dd68843f644ad150c.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/c516da0d4437c1b71cbe.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/9215803b7618879ee4fa.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/94434cc3cbe506140b0f.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/0f868c7ed15c577c27b9.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/c2d184300122b815a43f.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/c84400999c12635e3f99.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/68a3bf11b26fcaa607b6.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/1314387b77729bb1fefc.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/d4e29edc8abe1a6e28a2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/8523dd5fa7676d501d12.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/e908cad0924e3d9ce9c6.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/79dae0aba666d82a1519.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/9cffd1d223c6004ea986.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/233e014704fc8ecf9757.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-467\">Blanks</h3>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/41fbff3d6da42abbd1b8.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-468\">Calculation</h3>\n<h4 id=\"section-469\">0x01</h4>\n<p>对负数Y，求[-Y]补的过程已经完成了原码到补码的逆向操作 (即“取反加1”的逆过程)。<strong>取反[-Y]补的符号位​</strong>​等价于还原[Y]原的符号位。<br />\n<img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/db07fed4c6bb6b8d78d3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"section-470\">0x02</h4>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/a0a0e43738feaf8107d4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"section-471\">0x03</h4>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/fa42f2c4646296e6d2d0.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"section-472\">0x04</h4>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/0c719130b12d7cd02111.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/7c26cbbed2546d5b280a.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/f1fbc57c020b1380a92a.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h2 id=\"section-473\">K2</h2>\n<h3 id=\"section-474\">Choice</h3>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/8d1da10561db7d3da691.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/c1484ab3919eea406e8f.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/a14c0e2f64fd6c4680ce.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>阿姆达尔定律，程序优化后运行速度的提升计算方法，优化前运行所需时间 / 优化后运行所需时间 = 速度提升倍数<br />\n其中优化部分，相当于可以并行的程序使用多核来运行，提升核数来提高性能，每一个核都可以分配一个子任务(线程)来运行</p>\n<p><strong>除256小数点左移8位</strong>，10101011<strong>小数点</strong>左移8位得到 -0.10101011<br />\n规格化要求小数点左侧必须为1，故再左规1位，再补上 *(2^-1)，-1.0101011 *(2^-1)。<br />\n此时位数为 -1.0101011，移码为-1。标准移码偏移量为10000000，IEEE754标准的移码偏移量为01111111。<br />\n移码就是偏移量加上真值，故-1 + 01111111 = 01111110，得到IEEE754标准的移码 <strong>01111110</strong><br />\n-1.0101011小数点左侧的1是默认隐藏无需存储的，小数点右侧共23位，不够的补0，<strong>得到尾数 010 1011 0000 0000 0000 0000</strong><br />\n符号位 移码 尾数，连在一起得到 <strong>1</strong>   01111110   <strong>010 1011 0000 0000 0000 0000</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/e8f1e21aea51a41c419e.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>8FH变为二进制除去首位的偶校验位变为0F显然不是ASCII的F，<br />\n0FH也是，排除C、D选项。剩下的A、B选项确认哪个的二进制有偶数个1即可得到答案。</p>\n<p>MFM 改进调频制编码效率最高，且具有自同步能力</p>\n<p>其中x、y、z任意方向都有两个连接的边，故而一共有6个边。</p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/5a31f0d2bcb08419c0e4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/12cd14088d16c86306ea.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/fbeda47f336864cc2c6e.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-475\">Design</h3>\n<h4 id=\"section-476\">0x01</h4>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/ca6cbf1e7e1d6d4ce3f4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"section-477\">0x02</h4>\n<h5 id=\"section-478\">1</h5>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/4ac74438a9ee3831614f.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h5 id=\"section-479\">2</h5>\n<p>1位全加器(AI生成仅供参考)<br />\n<img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/483fd97ca1e109d5c3c3.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h5 id=\"section-480\">3</h5>\n<p>1位全加器设计的n位行波进位加法器(AI生成仅供参考)</p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/dc7186dd309a50982c85.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"section-481\">0x03</h4>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/baf21d96a473b05ec842.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h5 id=\"section-482\">1</h5>\n<p>如互斥微命令数为16时，还需要多表示<strong>用于表示16个微命令全部无效</strong>的情况，<br />\n故实际表示所需的位数需要多一种情况，17种情况表示只能使用 2^5 &gt; 16 表示，即5bit。<br />\n后续的字段编号所需要表示的情况的个数、表达所需的bit位数 全部都依照之前如法炮制。<br />\n其中地址选择要么是1要么是0，故而1bit即可表示，<br />\n控制存储器的单元数设定为4096个，即2^12，<br />\n这4096个存储单元如果要用地址进行编码，则需要12bit，即地址域12bit。</p>\n<h5 id=\"section-483\">2</h5>\n<p>单地址格式微指令对应的微指令控制器<br />\n<img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/bc2a8e9f2ef39ec4d8f5.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<h4 id=\"section-484\">0x04</h4>\n<h5 id=\"section-485\">1</h5>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/b8e5ed1bee1defb7f075.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>主存容量4GB，即 2^32，最大寻址空间 32bit，<br />\n其中 <strong>8路组相联(2^3)</strong> 说明块号用 3 bit即可表示，<br />\nCache容量 256KB (2^18)，即Cache内部地址为 18bit，<br />\n同时 Cache分为 8组 (2^3)，故而组号使用 3bit 即可表示。</p>\n<p>组号+块号+块内地址 就是 Cache 地址，这部分和主存每个区的结构是一样的。<br />\n参与相联比较的是<strong>区号</strong>和<strong>块号</strong>，14 + 3 bit 得到 17位，即参与相联比较的位数为 17。</p>\n<h5 id=\"section-486\">2</h5>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/428fb1e44621f016f080.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>Cache分为8组，每组有8块，地址变换表应是 8 * 8 = 64 行，<br />\n64行行号应是000000-111111，即0-63。6bit的地址中，<strong>前3位是组号，后3位是块号</strong>。<br />\n将 1234567H 和 FEDCBA98H 转为二进制后，先比较组号，再比较块号，最后比较区号，全部相同则命中Cache。</p>\n<h5 id=\"section-487\">3</h5>\n<p><strong>Cache(一级)的平均访问时间计算公式：Ta = h * Tc + (1-h) * (Tc + Tm) = Tc + (1-h) * Tm</strong><br />\nTa为平均访问时间，h为命中Cache的概率，Tc访问Cache的时间，<br />\n(1-h)为未命中率，Tm为未命中Cache将数据从主存取出装入Cache的时间，Tc是访问Cache的时间</p>\n<p>在有二级Cache的情况下，<strong>将 L2 Cache 与 主存 看作一部分</strong>，那么就可以直接套用前面的Cache平均访问时间计算公式了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"article-assets/computer-organization/35ae4f504969fa74884d.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n"
}
